    {
      "id": "text2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 78,
      "width": 270,
      "height": 304,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠ THE CEILING\n\nLucene MAX_DOC:\n2,147,483,647\ndocuments per index\n\nMost servers never\ncome close.\n\nDiscord's biggest\nguilds — internally\ncalled \"BFGs,\" Big\nFreaking Guilds —\nwere closing in.\n\nHit it → indexing for\nthat server just stops.\nNo negotiating.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠ THE CEILING\n\nLucene MAX_DOC:\n2,147,483,647\ndocuments per index\n\nMost servers never\ncome close.\n\nDiscord's biggest\nguilds — internally\ncalled \"BFGs,\" Big\nFreaking Guilds —\nwere closing in.\n\nHit it → indexing for\nthat server just stops.\nNo negotiating.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
